repository-code: "https://github.com/Apsiape/complexness-networks"
abstract: >-
  A resource theory for the reference frame of complexness in real
  quantum networks: frame locking, graded partial references, the
  transpose-charge code with span monotonicity, per-pair
  distillability dichotomy for frame-code states, a parity law for
  charge visibility, and partition-relative, activatable bound
  complexness. Includes a Lean 4 / Mathlib machine-verified core.
